{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_005yay_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_005yay_title", "source_sha256": "18af892c9d6ba9b06817c7a9830e60cf2f0e72b7e9f24746fa880963977aa6fc", "ja": "やよいと舞台裏", "zh": "与弥生的后台", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_005yay_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_005yay_synopsis", "source_sha256": "d81d1349b8fa6eeb44510cfbbf831843ed658dcfa17e8de3e18e5596298c4332", "ja": "やよいとの舞台裏の一幕です。", "zh": "这是与弥生的后台一幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_005yay_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_005yay_1000_005yay", "source_sha256": "063e8eadaec8d9232120ca9e9a84f4af4fa25c86e8decfbfc4839aa021fb3072", "ja": "あの、プロデューサー！\n今、なにか欲しいものとかないですか？", "zh": "那个，制作人！\n现在有没有什么想要的东西？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_005yay_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_005yay_1001_402cpr", "source_sha256": "1139e336ef62cd7fd6c0c482b99cee3957c0a04ba5f9c83348c969d499cafa63", "ja": "え？　欲しいものって……、\n突然どうしたんだ？", "zh": "诶？想要的东西……你怎么突然问这个？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_005yay_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_005yay_1002_005yay", "source_sha256": "cbb6ae966d90fc6dbd95db204089d3d98b2c7dcb0df79acab2e34709b055563a", "ja": "えっと、律子さんがプロ……じゃなくてチーフに、\n「出世のお祝いをあげないと」って！", "zh": "那个，律子姐说，制作……不对，是要给组长送“升职礼物”才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_005yay_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_005yay_1003_402cpr", "source_sha256": "9d8ec8f14efaf8db63dfee85d33b9c78ed61522bb7617e68bfefc7bebe25f5c5", "ja": "なるほど……。でも出世っていっても、やよいと同じで\nただ後輩ができたってだけだからなぁ。", "zh": "原来如此……不过说是升职，其实也和弥生一样，只是有了后辈而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_005yay_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_005yay_1004_005yay", "source_sha256": "bfa0ac0686523bd5c818a85db195448f619897ea58f4bbb2b3064ec03c3d9e41", "ja": "そうですか……、ええっ！　じゃあ私も出世しちゃった\nんですかー！？　お父さんもしたことないのに！！", "zh": "这样啊……诶！那我也升职了——！？爸爸都还没升过职呢！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_005yay_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_005yay_1005_402cpr", "source_sha256": "2e4562605d1f8c99a21733e49c4e95b5244d68028c8222d1483ab2f043040082", "ja": "い、いや！　だから多分、出世じゃないって……ん？\nいや、そうか。……そうかもな。", "zh": "不、不是！所以我说应该不是升职啦……嗯？\n不对，是这样吗。……说不定真是这样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_005yay_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_005yay_1006_005yay", "source_sha256": "3e679d62ca053befea9209edb4d18062ec9af024ecfa2ee951ba5f2a4b582269", "ja": "？　やっぱり出世ですか？", "zh": "果然是升职了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_005yay_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_005yay_1007_402cpr", "source_sha256": "072414066a43f7314c2cb2e36fa892f8895dd5db7d5ae844043d5d65a1a1b3c2", "ja": "いや。俺もやよいも後輩ができたってことは、それだけ\n765プロが出世したってことだ。みんなの力でな。", "zh": "不。我和弥生都有了后辈，说明765事务所也有了相应的发展。这都是靠大家的力量啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_005yay_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_005yay_1008_402cpr", "source_sha256": "4706c766ba87ac97d0d7fc23d064136d27a1472bb0c83b0f0af632ee0d9e214d", "ja": "だから、お祝いするのは、\n俺だけじゃないほうがいいかなって。", "zh": "所以我想，庆祝这件事还是不要只有我一个人比较好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_005yay_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_005yay_1009_005yay", "source_sha256": "dd960eae6ddf6aeb94940242d6408e1b81ffbb4aec41e135cc1d1a11698a3da9", "ja": "あっ、そっか……、そうですね、わかりました！\nそれじゃ、みんなでみんなをお祝いしましょー！", "zh": "啊，原来如此……嗯，说得对，我明白了！\n那就让大家一起庆祝大家吧——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_005yay_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_005yay_1010_005yay", "source_sha256": "341d3c4054a3fa964b3c5aee38f809e2dab6f36969c316803a4cca5c5c9fb591", "ja": "先輩になっておめでとうー！\n後輩になってくれてありがとうー、って！", "zh": "恭喜你成为前辈——！\n也要说声谢谢你成为后辈——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_005yay_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_005yay_1011_402cpr", "source_sha256": "612d6f1f198dace3a0921685f9300f62ce28411fe12810df9e1c3fd8a3e64f75", "ja": "ああ、そういうお祝いなら大歓迎だ。\n親睦会もかねて、みんなでお祝いパーティーといくか！", "zh": "啊，如果是那样的庆祝，我当然欢迎。\n正好也借此机会增进感情，大家一起开个庆祝派对吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_005yay_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_005yay_1012_005yay", "source_sha256": "93b0b00d6d7e63df8340b42530e35938db4c9912f435759f79003e44bed0d6ab", "ja": "うっうー！　私、みんなにお知らせしてきますね！\nお祝いパーティー、はじまるよーって。えへへっ♪", "zh": "呜呜～！我这就去通知大家！\n就说庆祝派对要开始啦——嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
